            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Haynoi 0.2.9</h2>

<h3>Changed</h3>
<ul>
<li>When a network route stalls, Haynoi now moves to the next route in 30</li>
</ul>
<p>  seconds instead of 90 — a rescued dictation lands in under a minute.</p>
<p><a href="https://github.com/sonpiaz/haynoi/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">View full changelog</a></p>
]]></description>
